---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout noindex title="Koa’s Sales CRM" description="Manage Koa’s Events inquiries, quotes, leads, proposals and bookings." canonical="https://www.koasevents.com/admin/quotes/">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-[var(--koa-sand)] py-12">
    <div class="container-shell">
      <div class="mb-8 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-clay)]">Admin</p>
          <h1 class="display mt-3 text-5xl">Sales CRM</h1>
          <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--koa-ink)]/58">Website inquiries, saved quotes, leads, proposals and booked events in one pipeline—with proposal pricing, acceptance and package conversion analytics.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/admin/" class="link-arrow">Admin home →</a>
      </div>

      <div data-unauthorized class="hidden rounded-[1.4rem] bg-white p-8">Sign in with an administrator account at <a class="underline" href="/admin/">Koa’s Admin</a>.</div>

      <div data-admin-ui class="hidden grid gap-8">
        <section class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-5">
          <article class="rounded-[1.3rem] bg-white p-5 shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)]"><p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-clay)]">Inquiries</p><p data-stat-inquiries class="display mt-3 text-4xl text-[var(--koa-forest)]">0</p></article>
          <article class="rounded-[1.3rem] bg-white p-5 shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)]"><p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-clay)]">Leads</p><p data-stat-leads class="display mt-3 text-4xl text-[var(--koa-forest)]">0</p></article>
          <article class="rounded-[1.3rem] bg-white p-5 shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)]"><p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-clay)]">Proposals</p><p data-stat-proposals class="display mt-3 text-4xl text-[var(--koa-forest)]">0</p></article>
          <article class="rounded-[1.3rem] bg-[var(--koa-forest)] p-5 text-white"><p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-amber-light)]">Booked</p><p data-stat-booked class="display mt-3 text-4xl">0</p></article>
          <article class="rounded-[1.3rem] bg-[var(--koa-ink)] p-5 text-white"><p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-amber-light)]">Saved quote value</p><p data-stat-value class="display mt-3 text-4xl">$0</p></article>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-[var(--koa-ink)] p-6 text-white shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)] sm:p-7">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
            <div><p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-amber-light)]">Needs attention</p><h2 class="display mt-3 text-4xl">Work the next action, not the whole pipeline.</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-white/56">Accepted proposals, new inquiries, viewed proposals, qualified leads and draft proposals are surfaced here in action order.</p></div>
            <span data-work-count class="rounded-full border border-white/12 bg-white/[.06] px-4 py-2 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-white/70">0 items</span>
          </div>
          <div data-work-queue class="mt-6 grid gap-3 lg:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3"></div>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-white p-6 shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)] sm:p-7">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-clay)]">Awaiting response</p>
              <h2 class="display mt-3 text-4xl">Leads still waiting on us</h2>
              <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--koa-ink)]/56">Open inquiries and leads with no logged staff response, ordered by the oldest client request first. The internal SLA reminder is based on weekday business hours in Hawai‘i.</p>
            </div>
            <span data-unanswered-count class="rounded-full bg-[var(--koa-sand)] px-4 py-2 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-[var(--koa-forest)]">0 waiting</span>
          </div>
          <div data-unanswered-leads class="mt-6 grid gap-3 lg:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3"></div>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-white p-6 shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)] sm:p-7">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between">
            <div><p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-clay)]">Package funnel</p><h2 class="display mt-3 text-4xl">From interest to booked event</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--koa-ink)]/56">Views are unique browser sessions that selected a package. Later stages count saved quotes and CRM records.</p></div>
            <p class="text-xs leading-5 text-[var(--koa-ink)]/45">Conversion rates are directional funnel indicators, not cross-device identity matching.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full min-w-[900px] border-collapse text-sm">
              <thead><tr class="border-b border-[var(--koa-line)] text-left text-[.58rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-[var(--koa-clay)]"><th class="py-3 pr-4">Collection</th><th class="py-3 pr-4">Viewed</th><th class="py-3 pr-4">Saved</th><th class="py-3 pr-4">Leads</th><th class="py-3 pr-4">Proposals</th><th class="py-3 pr-4">Booked</th><th class="py-3">Rates</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody data-funnel></tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="mobile-bar" class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-[var(--koa-forest)] p-6 text-white shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)] sm:p-7" data-mobile-bar-section>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 xl:flex-row xl:items-end xl:justify-between">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-amber-light)]">Koa’s Mobile Bar</p>
              <h2 class="display mt-3 text-4xl">Mobile Bar pipeline + reporting</h2>
              <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-white/62">Filter Mobile Bar opportunities, see lead and quote status, inspect calculator pricing, work follow-up tasks, and track package conversion without mixing these leads into venue-only reporting.</p>
            </div>
            <span data-mobile-count class="w-fit rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] px-4 py-2 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-white/75">0 records</span>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-6">
            <article class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[.06] p-4"><p class="text-[.58rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-white/55">Open</p><strong data-mobile-stat-open class="display mt-2 block text-3xl">0</strong></article>
            <article class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[.06] p-4"><p class="text-[.58rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-white/55">Booked</p><strong data-mobile-stat-booked class="display mt-2 block text-3xl">0</strong></article>
            <article class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[.06] p-4"><p class="text-[.58rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-white/55">Follow-ups due</p><strong data-mobile-stat-followups class="display mt-2 block text-3xl">0</strong></article>
            <article class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[.06] p-4"><p class="text-[.58rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-white/55">Estimate value</p><strong data-mobile-stat-value class="display mt-2 block text-3xl">$0</strong></article>
            <article class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[.06] p-4"><p class="text-[.58rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-white/55">Avg. estimate</p><strong data-mobile-stat-average class="display mt-2 block text-3xl">$0</strong></article>
            <article class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[.06] p-4"><p class="text-[.58rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-white/55">Custom add-ons</p><strong data-mobile-stat-custom class="display mt-2 block text-3xl">0</strong></article>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 xl:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr]">
            <section class="rounded-[1.2rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/[.05] p-5">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-3"><div><p class="text-[.58rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-white/55">Revenue forecast</p><h3 class="display mt-2 text-3xl">Next six months</h3></div><p class="max-w-sm text-[.68rem] leading-5 text-white/48">Booked revenue is firm CRM value. Open pipeline is probability-weighted by stage and should be treated as a planning forecast, not guaranteed revenue.</p></div>
              <div data-mobile-forecast class="mt-5 grid gap-3"></div>
            </section>
            <section class="rounded-[1.2rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/[.05] p-5">
              <div><p class="text-[.58rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-white/55">Conversion health</p><h3 class="display mt-2 text-3xl">Pipeline efficiency</h3></div>
              <div data-mobile-conversion class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"></div>
            </section>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 xl:grid-cols-2">
            <section class="rounded-[1.2rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/[.05] p-5">
              <div><p class="text-[.58rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-white/55">Package popularity</p><h3 class="display mt-2 text-3xl">What clients choose</h3></div>
              <div data-mobile-package-popularity class="mt-5 grid gap-3"></div>
            </section>
            <section class="rounded-[1.2rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/[.05] p-5">
              <div><p class="text-[.58rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-white/55">Lead sources</p><h3 class="display mt-2 text-3xl">Where inquiries originate</h3></div>
              <div data-mobile-lead-sources class="mt-5 grid gap-3"></div>
            </section>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 xl:grid-cols-[1.2fr_.8fr]">
            <section class="rounded-[1.2rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/[.05] p-5">
              <div><p class="text-[.58rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-white/55">Upcoming events</p><h3 class="display mt-2 text-3xl">What is on the calendar</h3></div>
              <div data-mobile-upcoming class="mt-5 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2"></div>
            </section>
            <section class="rounded-[1.2rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/[.05] p-5">
              <div><p class="text-[.58rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-white/55">Staffing forecast</p><h3 class="display mt-2 text-3xl">Bartender demand</h3></div>
              <div data-mobile-staffing class="mt-5 grid gap-2"></div>
            </section>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 grid gap-3 rounded-[1.2rem] border border-white/10 bg-black/10 p-4 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-5">
            <label class="grid gap-2 text-[.62rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.08em] text-white/62">Stage
              <select data-mobile-filter-stage class="rounded-xl border border-white/15 bg-[var(--koa-ink)] px-3 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold normal-case tracking-normal text-white">
                <option value="all">All stages</option><option value="inquiry">Inquiry</option><option value="lead">Lead</option><option value="proposal">Proposal</option><option value="booked">Booked</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <label class="grid gap-2 text-[.62rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.08em] text-white/62">Package
              <select data-mobile-filter-package class="rounded-xl border border-white/15 bg-[var(--koa-ink)] px-3 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold normal-case tracking-normal text-white">
                <option value="all">All packages</option><option value="mobile-oahu">Oahu</option><option value="mobile-maui">Maui</option><option value="mobile-big-island">Big Island</option><option value="mobile-custom">Custom</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <label class="grid gap-2 text-[.62rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.08em] text-white/62">Quote status
              <select data-mobile-filter-quote class="rounded-xl border border-white/15 bg-[var(--koa-ink)] px-3 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold normal-case tracking-normal text-white">
                <option value="all">All quote states</option><option value="website-estimate">Website estimate</option><option value="draft">Proposal draft</option><option value="sent">Proposal sent</option><option value="viewed">Proposal viewed</option><option value="accepted">Proposal accepted</option><option value="booked">Proposal booked</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <label class="grid gap-2 text-[.62rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.08em] text-white/62">Follow-up
              <select data-mobile-filter-followup class="rounded-xl border border-white/15 bg-[var(--koa-ink)] px-3 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold normal-case tracking-normal text-white">
                <option value="all">All</option><option value="due">Needs follow-up</option><option value="clear">No task due</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <label class="grid gap-2 text-[.62rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.08em] text-white/62">Sort
              <select data-mobile-sort class="rounded-xl border border-white/15 bg-[var(--koa-ink)] px-3 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold normal-case tracking-normal text-white">
                <option value="recent">Most recent</option><option value="event-date">Event date</option><option value="estimate-high">Estimate: high to low</option><option value="followup">Follow-up priority</option>
              </select>
            </label>
          </div>

          <div data-mobile-records class="mt-5 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2 2xl:grid-cols-3"></div>

          <div class="mt-7 overflow-x-auto rounded-[1.2rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/[.05] p-4">
            <div class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><div><p class="text-[.58rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-white/55">Package report</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-white/65">Mobile Bar funnel by package from CRM records currently loaded.</p></div></div>
            <table class="w-full min-w-[760px] border-collapse text-sm">
              <thead><tr class="border-b border-white/10 text-left text-[.56rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-white/50"><th class="py-3 pr-4">Package</th><th class="py-3 pr-4">Inquiries</th><th class="py-3 pr-4">Leads</th><th class="py-3 pr-4">Proposals</th><th class="py-3 pr-4">Booked</th><th class="py-3 pr-4">Avg estimate</th><th class="py-3">Follow-ups</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody data-mobile-report></tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-white p-6 shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)] sm:p-7">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between">
            <div><p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-clay)]">Pipeline</p><h2 class="display mt-3 text-4xl">Inquiries → leads → proposals → booked</h2></div>
            <form data-search-form class="flex w-full max-w-xl gap-2">
              <input data-search-input type="search" placeholder="Name, email, quote ID, record ID…" class="min-w-0 flex-1 rounded-full border border-[var(--koa-line)] px-5 py-3 text-sm" />
              <button class="rounded-full bg-[var(--koa-forest)] px-5 py-3 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-white">Search</button>
            </form>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
            <span data-selected-count class="text-xs font-bold text-[var(--koa-ink)]/55">0 selected</span>
            <button type="button" data-bulk-lost class="rounded-full border border-[var(--koa-line)] px-4 py-2 text-[.58rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.08em] text-[var(--koa-forest)]">Mark selected lost</button>
            <button type="button" data-bulk-trash class="rounded-full border border-red-200 bg-red-50 px-4 py-2 text-[.58rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.08em] text-red-700">Move selected to Trash</button>
            <button type="button" data-clear-selection class="rounded-full px-3 py-2 text-[.58rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.08em] text-[var(--koa-ink)]/45">Clear</button>
          </div>
          <p data-message class="mt-4 text-sm text-[var(--koa-ink)]/58"></p>
          <div data-pipeline class="mt-6 grid gap-5 xl:grid-cols-4"></div>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-white p-6 shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)] sm:p-7">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-3">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-clay)]">Lost leads</p>
              <h2 class="display mt-3 text-4xl">Review, reopen, or clean up lost opportunities</h2>
              <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--koa-ink)]/56">Lost inquiries and leads stay searchable here until you reopen them or move them into the 30-day Trash.</p>
            </div>
            <span data-lost-count class="rounded-full bg-[var(--koa-sand)] px-3 py-2 text-xs font-black text-[var(--koa-forest)]">0 records</span>
          </div>
          <div data-lost-list class="mt-6 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2"></div>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-white p-6 shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)] sm:p-7">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
            <div><p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-clay)]">Booked events</p><h2 class="display mt-3 text-4xl">Contracts, payments + upcoming events</h2></div>
            <p class="max-w-md text-xs leading-5 text-[var(--koa-ink)]/45">A record enters Booked automatically when the agreement is signed and the reservation deposit is recorded.</p>
          </div>
          <div data-booked-dashboard class="mt-6 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2"></div>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-white p-6 shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)] sm:p-7">
          <div><p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-clay)]">Saved configurations</p><h2 class="display mt-3 text-4xl">Quote builder snapshots</h2></div>
          <div data-quote-list class="mt-6 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2"></div>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-white p-6 shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)] sm:p-7">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-3">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-clay)]">Trash</p>
              <h2 class="display mt-3 text-4xl">Deleted inquiries + leads</h2>
              <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--koa-ink)]/56">Deleted inquiry and lead records remain here for 30 days, then are permanently purged automatically.</p>
            </div>
            <span data-trash-count class="rounded-full bg-[var(--koa-sand)] px-3 py-2 text-xs font-black text-[var(--koa-forest)]">0 records</span>
          </div>
          <div data-trash-list class="mt-6 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2"></div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <dialog data-convert-dialog class="w-[min(94vw,760px)] rounded-[1.5rem] border-0 bg-white p-0 shadow-2xl backdrop:bg-black/40">
    <form data-convert-form class="p-7 sm:p-8">
      <input type="hidden" name="quoteId" />
      <input type="hidden" name="kind" />
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
        <div><p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-clay)]">Convert saved quote</p><h2 data-convert-title class="display mt-3 text-4xl">Create lead</h2><p data-convert-summary class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--koa-ink)]/58"></p></div>
        <button type="button" data-close-convert class="rounded-full border border-[var(--koa-line)] px-3 py-2 text-sm">×</button>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold">Client / couple name<input name="name" class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--koa-line)] px-4 py-3" /></label>
        <label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold">Email<input name="email" type="email" class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--koa-line)] px-4 py-3" /></label>
        <label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold">Phone<input name="phone" type="tel" class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--koa-line)] px-4 py-3" /></label>
        <label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold">Event date<input name="eventDate" type="date" class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--koa-line)] px-4 py-3" /></label>
        <label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold sm:col-span-2">Internal notes<textarea name="notes" rows="4" class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--koa-line)] px-4 py-3"></textarea></label>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><button class="rounded-full bg-[var(--koa-forest)] px-6 py-3.5 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-white">Create record</button><button type="button" data-close-convert class="rounded-full border border-[var(--koa-line)] px-6 py-3.5 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-[var(--koa-forest)]">Cancel</button></div>
      <p data-convert-message class="mt-4 text-sm text-[var(--koa-ink)]/58"></p>
    </form>
  </dialog>

  <dialog data-proposal-dialog class="w-[min(96vw,1100px)] rounded-[1.5rem] border-0 bg-white p-0 shadow-2xl backdrop:bg-black/40">
    <form data-proposal-form class="max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto p-6 sm:p-8">
      <input type="hidden" name="recordId" />
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
        <div><p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-clay)]">Proposal editor</p><h2 data-proposal-title class="display mt-3 text-4xl">Proposal</h2><p data-proposal-link-wrap class="mt-3 hidden text-sm"><a data-proposal-link target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link-arrow">Open client proposal →</a></p></div>
        <button type="button" data-close-proposal class="rounded-full border border-[var(--koa-line)] px-3 py-2 text-sm">×</button>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-7 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold">Status<select name="status" class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--koa-line)] px-4 py-3"><option value="draft">Draft</option><option value="sent">Sent</option><option value="viewed">Viewed</option><option value="accepted">Accepted</option><option value="declined">Declined</option><option value="expired">Expired</option><option value="booked">Booked</option></select></label>
        <label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold">Valid through<input name="expirationDate" type="date" class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--koa-line)] px-4 py-3" /></label>
        <label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold">Event date<input name="eventDate" type="date" class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--koa-line)] px-4 py-3" /></label>
        <label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold">Client / couple<input name="name" class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--koa-line)] px-4 py-3" /></label>
        <label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold">Email<input name="email" type="email" class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--koa-line)] px-4 py-3" /></label>
        <label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold">Phone<input name="phone" type="tel" class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--koa-line)] px-4 py-3" /></label>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8">
        <div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-4"><div><p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-clay)]">Editable pricing</p><h3 class="display mt-2 text-3xl">Proposal line items</h3></div><button type="button" data-add-line class="rounded-full border border-[var(--koa-forest)] px-4 py-2 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-[var(--koa-forest)]">Add line +</button></div>
        <div data-line-items class="mt-4 grid gap-3"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold">Discount amount<input name="discountAmount" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--koa-line)] px-4 py-3" /></label>
